      "writtenOn": "2018-03-02T13:49:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is right. This method should only be called on NetworkCapabilities objects that describe the capabilities of a network, and not on one that describe requested capabilities – those may not have non requestable capabilities as the name imply. And NetworkCapabilities objects that describe the capabilities of a network always have mUnwantedCapabilities \u003d 0 IIUC.\n\nBut to go further, even if my analysis above is wrong, then this is mightily confusing ; a caller would probably expect this to return a capability this NetworkCapabilities include, not one that it marks as unwanted. However, this would return either indiscriminately and without indication.",
